Package: MStargetR
Title: Targeted MRM Mass Spectrometry Data Processing and Quality Control
Version: 1.4.0
Description: Provides a comprehensive workflow for processing targeted multiple
    reaction monitoring (MRM) mass spectrometry data. Includes tools for raw data
    conversion via msConvert, peak integration, quality control assessment, batch
    correction using signal drift algorithms, and interactive visualisation through
    a Shiny application. Designed for liquid chromatography-mass spectrometry
    (LC-MS) metabolomics workflows.
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
URL: https://github.com/MStargetR/MStargetR
BugReports: https://github.com/MStargetR/MStargetR/issues
License: MIT + file LICENSE
